Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 28. Get Issue Distribution by Category (Bar Chart Data)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repoId}}/analytics/type-distribution
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 29. Get Top Problematic Files (Horizontal Bar Chart Data)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repoId}}/analytics/top-files?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

