### Developer Analytics & Hotspots Endpoints (Module 9 - Protected)
### ====================================================================

### 30. Sync Extended Commits & Compute Developer Analytics
# @name syncCommitData
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repoId}}/sync-commits
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 31. Get Contributor Leaderboard & Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repoId}}/analytics/contributors
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

