### 35. Get Technical Debt High-Risk Files with Explanations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repoId}}/analytics/technical-debt
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json


### ====================================================================
### AI/LLM Microservice Endpoints (Module 10 - Protected & Hourly Rate-Limited)
### ====================================================================

### 36. Explain Code Snippet
# @name explainCodeSnippet
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/explain-code
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "export const verifyToken = (token: string) => jwt.verify(token, process.env.JWT_SECRET!);",
  "language": "typescript",
  "file_path": "src/lib/jwt.ts",
  "context": "Express backend auth helper"
}

### 37. Explain Whole File Architecture
# @name explainWholeFile
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/explain-file
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "file_path": "server/src/services/code-analysis.service.ts",
  "language": "typescript"
}

### 38. Suggest AI Fix for Static Analysis Issue
# @name suggestAIFix
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/suggest-fix
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "issue_id": "65d75cf9e1d84f23b890abcf",
  "file_path": "server/src/database.ts",
  "line_number": 15,
  "issue_type": "security",
  "severity": "critical",
  "message": "Hardcoded AWS Access Key detected in source code",
  "code_snippet": "const awsKey = 'AKIA1234567890ABCDEF';",
  "rule_id": "security/hardcoded-aws-key"
}

### 39. Get AI Usage & Hourly Quota Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/usage
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 40. Microservice Health Check (Proxied)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/health
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ====================================================================
### MODULE 11: CODE VECTOR EMBEDDINGS & ATLAS VECTOR SEARCH
### ====================================================================

### 41. Trigger Codebase Vector Indexing (Async)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repositoryId}}/index-code
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 42. Get Vector Indexing Status & Total Chunks Count
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repositoryId}}/index-status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 43. Semantic Vector Search Across Repository Code
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repositoryId}}/search-code
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "JWT token verification and authentication middleware",
  "limit": 5
}




### 19. Create Project - Success (Protected)
# @name createProject
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "RepoRadar Core Engine",
  "description": "AI-powered AST static analysis and vulnerability scanning pipeline"
}

### 13. List All Projects (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 14. Get Project By ID (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 15. Update Project (Protected)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "RepoRadar Core Engine (Updated v1.4)",
  "description": "Updated description with enhanced multi-language AST support"
}

### 16. Delete Project (Protected)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ====================================================================
### Validation & Auth Error Test Cases
### ====================================================================

### 17. Auth Error: Call Protected Endpoint without Token (Expect 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories
Accept: application/json

### 18. Auth Error: Call Protected Endpoint with Invalid Token (Expect 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token-12345
Accept: application/json

### 19. Sync Error: Sync Repositories without GitHub Linked (Expect 400 GITHUB_NOT_LINKED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 20. Validation Error: Select Repository with invalid ObjectId (Expect 400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/invalid-mongo-id/select
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json
